00:41:06,940 --> 00:41:09,179
So that night, they decide to sneak into the McCormick house.

948
00:41:16,230 --> 00:41:16,940
Did you get it?

949
00:41:17,139 --> 00:41:18,519
Hold on, I'm checking for robot guards.

950
00:41:18,679 --> 00:41:20,260
There's not gonna be any robot guards, retard!

951
