You mean three little boys who have no idea how to steer a boat?

1026
00:44:47,530 --> 00:44:49,059
Well, that escalated quickly.

1027
00:44:49,320 --> 00:44:51,369
The three of them are now trapped inside the oil refinery,

1028
00:44:51,539 --> 00:44:55,199
and Stan realizes that he'll have to admit what he did so their parents can come and save them.

1029
00:44:55,599 --> 00:44:56,159
Uh, hey, Dad.

1030
00:44:56,360 --> 00:44:57,400
Stan, you're alive!

1031
00:44:57,719 --> 00:44:59,360
Dad, we're trapped in Beaverton.

1032
00:44:59,710 --> 00:45:00,900
We're trying to save everyone.

1033
00:45:01,500 --> 00:45:02,750
You must stay indoors.

1034
00:45:03,079 --> 00:45:03,980
Do not try to go out.

1035
00:45:04,400 --> 00:45:06,039
Global warming has brought in a new ice age.

1036
00:45:06,760 --> 00:45:07,480
I need to tell you something.

1037
00:45:08,000 --> 00:45:08,760
What is it, son?

1038
00:45:08,940 --> 00:45:10,659
Nothing. Can you just come get us, please?

1039
00:45:10,880 --> 00:45:11,940
You just stay put, son.

1040
00:45:12,300 --> 00:45:13,300
I'm coming for you.

1041
00:45:13,400 --> 00:45:13,980
So close.

1042
00:45:14,260 --> 00:45:18,460
While their parents bravely but stupidly make their way to Beaverton wearing too many clothes and passing out from heat

1043
00:45:18,460 --> 00:45:21,860
exhaustion and dehydration, the oil refinery is starting to collapse.

1044
00:45:22,019 --> 00:45:24,380
The boys make their way to the roof to try and escape, but...

1045
00:45:24,380 --> 00:45:25,400
Not so fast, pal.

1046
00:45:25,639 --> 00:45:26,159
What are you doing?

1047
00:45:26,360 --> 00:45:27,159
Hand over the gold.

1048
00:45:27,420 --> 00:45:28,840
Oh, boy, here we go again.

1049
00:45:29,179 --> 00:45:29,659
What gold?

1050
00:45:30,360 --> 00:45:31,380
You know what I'm talking about.

1051
00:45:31,539 --> 00:45:33,380
No, Cartman, I have no idea what you're talking about.

1052
00:45:33,719 --> 00:45:35,980
All Jews carry gold in a little bag around their necks.

1053
00:45:36,340 --> 00:45:38,559
You do not carry gold in a little bag around their necks, Cartman.

1054
00:45:38,679 --> 00:45:39,400
Stop playing around.

1055
00:45:39,679 --> 00:45:40,679
I'm not playing around, Cap.

1056
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:42,659
If we survive this, I don't intend to live in poverty.

1057
00:45:42,920 --> 00:45:43,920
Give me your Jew gold now.

1058
00:45:44,119 --> 00:45:49,039
Yes, apparently, Cartman would rather die in the refinery than give up on this quest for Kyle's Jew gold.

1059
00:45:49,260 --> 00:45:50,840
Excuse me, don't have time for your stupid jokes.

1060
00:45:50,980 --> 00:45:51,480
We're gonna die.

1061
00:45:51,760 --> 00:45:53,639
Yes, but you can live if you give me your Jew gold.

1062
00:45:53,820 --> 00:45:54,800
The decision is yours, Cap.

1063
00:45:54,940 --> 00:45:57,719
God damn it, you know I don't carry gold in a little bag around my neck, Cartman.

1064
00:45:57,860 --> 00:45:58,639
What do you want from me?

1065
00:45:59,059 --> 00:46:00,800
I want your Jew gold.

1066
00:46:01,340 --> 00:46:02,019
Okay, fine.

1067
00:46:02,199 --> 00:46:03,920
Here. Now let's go.

1068
00:46:04,119 --> 00:46:06,320
What? What did that?

1069
00:46:06,340 --> 00:46:06,860
What just happened?

1070
00:46:07,420 --> 00:46:11,059
I know that all Jews carry fake bags of gold around their necks to keep the real bags of gold around their necks safe.

1071
00:46:11,380 --> 00:46:12,599
Hand over the real Jew gold, Cap.

1072
00:46:12,780 --> 00:46:15,579
Oh, sorry.

1073
00:46:15,579 --> 00:46:16,280
I need a minute.

1074
00:46:21,050 --> 00:46:23,599
Even though I've seen this a thousand times,

1075
