I can never just like process all of that in like one sitting.

1076
00:46:30,260 --> 00:46:33,820
But yeah, Cartman, Cartman was apparently right.

1077
00:46:34,719 --> 00:46:36,039
Or was he?

1078
00:46:36,409 --> 00:46:40,900
We never found out if there actually was any gold in that second bag, now did we?

1079
