We only know that Kyle did in fact carry two bags around his neck,

1080
00:46:43,960 --> 00:46:46,250
but it could have been a plan to mess with Cartman all along.

1081
00:46:46,460 --> 00:46:50,119
So yeah, Cartman may have been right, but I'm gonna say that the jury's still out on this one.

1082
00:46:50,239 --> 00:46:54,460
But hey, if you want to listen to me dissect more diabolical scenes involving other cartoon characters,

1083
00:46:54,659 --> 00:46:57,260
